    "authoredAt": "2026-08-11",
    "note": "Art key 'circuit', selected from the brief. Derived from base token set 'brickfarm', whose scale, spacing, typography, motion, cameras and audio come through unchanged; only the palette colours and the moods are re-decided. Role luminances come from rqe.art.direction.VALUE_LADDER, which is shared by every art key and was set from reference measurements -- never from a capture of the game this set governs."
